(2) use subscripts for nonidentical ce'u in the same ka bridi
(3) Consider whether bare ce'u =3D (a) "ce'u xi pa" or (b) "ce'u xi n+1".
(4) Consider going for (b) (=3D status quo) but using ke'a as an equivalent
of ce'u xi pa.

